<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-15T11:18:21.495Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:18:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Yemeni government forces have withdrawn from positions around Dhubab Airport and the Bab al-Mandeb area, allowing Houthi fighters to seize control of the strategic strait. In the same period Houthi forces intercepted Saudi-led coalition missile and drone attacks and killed a senior Yemeni military commander in clashes in Al-Jawf. The Houthis also stepped up missile strikes on Saudi Arabia, targeting Riyadh and other sites, while Saudi air defenses intercepted several missiles and a drone over eastern Saudi territory. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQVW9oR0pfVGQ2U3NYTWdTRktiZ1Z4TUFnb0UyUHJ0MTJ0ejVtQU12anZRTDg1ZmQ1cGlaS3VaUWYtM3MzdlBEcVRnVVZ1T2RONmtzMVg2SFRHeWRGQXVHb01WR1NCd1pwNXo3R0c3dWRwTHlaSXFYWlctYjhSWlVWb3BXSGNqdEdlMERpYVNQaEVfRUpmRFhWSURlcVFhNmNMekNlMy1XbDNEZVphNDJEQlA4T0pkYmFQZjlHdlBFaEtfYnpBRTE3X0E1elZXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQRWFZVVhzUDVtSFIwNTY3QjZWN2NIRzJXVmdMWEc4ZEtKQlpQb1NBZ2VnUGxtaFZtc1IyLUZ0ZGFXZUtaUEVsd1lSNG1vSmF0Sy1KRndMcDdSYTdYaWI0ZXowSEwzLUhRN0ZKTVlhZ2ZiT2M1RTRwMEF4dEJQVGY4aExtUnF5T1RQLTlOMHdsLTVUblN2QUN1SXhmZ3hjZWV1?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNMlA5SnBMcmZLcy1EZmJrcDNKbTBraW5IOXlEYm1ldWdPYkRHWTdwLXRkMVNSM1N6MmhjVER3UGN1elhtdVRPTTVCVHRQZUxfeVI2WXI1clRpeHQxaHdWMVdIb0JBWGpTbDZ3UlpaMnpELUxuSmZLekRWbEFkSjFfNGJmLUVWcnE2ZEdFWXcyd2tUNjY3eGh2VFRGOEgxWWtWclUtMWVUVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;アラブニュース&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPNEJOa21OLUVmV2M1UUZsdnZSQVhTM0Q5Zk5aSG13Vk5La1RYaU9YQ3hoakJiSzNpZnFzXzRSU19JeHh3cjRvNzB1T3dXbW0